// Syncthing: what is synced between the 24/7 PC and your other PCs (see README, "Running on two PCs").
// Only the live state is synced: candles, models, logs, paper trials and your settings. The code comes from
// GitHub instead, so .git, .venv and the source files are never synced. The first matching line wins.

// temporary files from atomic saves (config.atomic) and this PC's own alert viewer state
*.tmp
/viewer_state.json

!/data
!/models
!/logs
!/paper
!/paper_alts
!/paper_stocks
!/paper_archive_*
!/paper_alts_archive_*
!/paper_stocks_archive_*
!/portfolio.json
!/stock_portfolio.json
!/grid_bots.json
!/notify.json
!/dashboard_auth.json
!/auth_tokens.json
!/signals_log.csv

// everything else (code, .git, .venv, reports, tools) stays per PC
*
